# Root-level ignores. Build output and per-stack junk are handled by
# backend/.gitignore and frontend/.gitignore — keep those concerns there
# and only add things here that live at, or span, the repo root.

# Generated video output from the /brag skill. Tens of MB of .mp4 per run,
# and git history is permanent: committing these once makes every future
# clone carry them forever, even after they're deleted.
brag-output/
brag-output-why-login/

# Runtime evidence uploads. In production this folder fills with passenger-
# submitted photos about identifiable drivers — user data, not source.
backend/RydrSafe.API/wwwroot/evidence/

# Stray root lockfile created by an accidental `npm install` at the repo root.
# It's an empty stub; the real one is frontend/package-lock.json. Anchored
# with a leading slash so the frontend's lockfile stays tracked.
/package-lock.json

# OS clutter
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
